{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……话虽这么说，还是好漫长呢。”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2148", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“到了第二天，班上就飘散着一股疲惫感……”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然考试开始后就必须全力冲刺，但相对的精神上的疲劳也来得很迅速。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在某种意义上，或许第一天的振奋直接就导致了隔天一早的消沉。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“考了之后发现自己努力得还不够，这就是太天真的证据。大家都太不像话了。”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 229, "voice": "ar4089", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一针见血呢。这种锋利就是年级榜首的秘诀啊安洁懂了。”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2149", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，安洁虽然一直碎碎念，却没什么疲倦的感觉欸？”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 240, "voice": "ht0366", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该不会你其实很有把握！？只有你一个人这样太狡猾了！”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "sn0377", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不、不是的，不是那样……”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2150", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是因为安洁有主人在。所以不管发生什么事每天都Happy到不行呢。”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2151", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“居然趁机放闪！”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 240, "voice": "ht0367", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“早知道就不要提了……”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 235, "voice": "sn0378", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君则是已经完全习惯安洁这种发言了……”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 229, "voice": "ar4090", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该说，我也是每天都很Happy喔。”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这男的又这样随口就……”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 229, "voice": "ar4091", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“班上开开心心的只有我们呢，啊哈哈。”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2152", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其实我内心是有点抱歉的。我环顾整间教室。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯～没有精神的感觉……", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2153", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了，主人！”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2154", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，嗯。怎么了？”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有一点时间，安洁久违地帮大家泡个茶吧！”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2155", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来～帮大家倒茶啰～”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2156", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是，眼前就出现了许久不见的景象。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁用神乎其技的手法泡好了茶，带着亲切的笑容帮班上的同学们倒茶。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请慢用。可以舒缓情绪喔！”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2157", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔喔……！”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "da0046", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来，请慢用。趁热喝吧，请用请用。”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2158", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢安洁！”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sb0049", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会不会，呵呵。能让各位高兴安洁也觉得很开心～”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2159", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "喔喔，教室的气氛很快就变得温馨愉快了……", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“～♪”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2160", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来，新的一壶泡好了喔！大家会喝吧，呐？”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2161", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然会喝！”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "结女学生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "jb0032", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哇～好久没喝到安洁的茶了～”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 236, "voice": "ja0060", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“失去之后才懂得珍惜……啊啊，有女仆在的日子真的很幸福。”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 238, "voice": "jc0055", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“讨厌啦，大家真会夸奖～听到这些话，安洁不就又想帮大家续杯了吗？”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 223, "voice": "ag2162", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“拜托你了，拜托！”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 238, "voice": "jc0056", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "似乎不只是茶，连安洁本身的存在都大受好评。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "失去之后才懂得珍惜吗……", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "的确现在是我独占了安洁吧。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，但是我正是想独占……”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 228, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过……野生女仆时期的安洁果然是“大家的女仆”呢。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我必须连同大家的份一起珍惜安洁。嗯，要让她幸福才行。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我就这样想着，度过了一天天的考试。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
